-- statement:
--   For any unbounded variation spectrally negative Levy process with zero negative Levy measure and unbounded cap C, preserve the original arbitrary subordinated stopping clocks and original post-right-dividend terminal branch and Iic inclusive Stieltjes cash. The original exact integrable reward has expected value at most w(x). This is the top-cap special case of avram_p4_f8_zero_nu_original_exact_clock_HJB_expected_upper; derive the original strict-mask expectation from an existing proved source and the exact inclusive cash contact inequality.
